WEBVTT

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.510
<i>That's the village?</i>

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:40.840
<i>Yep, that's it.</i>

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.480
<i>West Oasis District,
Frontier Village #21...</i>

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Our village.</i>

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.880
<i>Talk about a scruffy excuse for a town...</i>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.850
<i>All frontier towns're like that...</i>

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.470
<i>But it's a different story
if they strike water...</i>

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.930
<i>"Even oases start from a single well."</i>

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.600
<i>If we had our own village with water,</i>

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.730
<i>we could live on easy street
the rest of our lives!</i>

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>Assuming there really is water.
They'll be finding out soon.</i>

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.610
<i>Let's come back when they do.</i>

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:16.220
<i>I bet this shabby village'll
be sparkling when we do...</i>

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:26.330
<i>T-t-this is bad!</i>

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.460
<i>"West Oasis District Frontier Village #21"</i>

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.830
<i>Frontier villages...
well-digging villages.</i>

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:44.470
<i>Hoping to strike it rich,
poor people throughout the Kanto</i>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:48.830
<i>come together and form these
frontier villages to dig wells.</i>

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.220
Finally here...

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.310
I'm takin' the blindfold off.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:10.380
