00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.420
<i>W-what?!</i>

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.630
<i>Plastic explosives and nitro...</i>

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.430
<i>Damn! We can't even touch it!</i>

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:52.740
Oh, how nice of you all to be here!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:56.410
Now the entertainment can begin!

00:20:56.410 --> 00:21:00.790
There's more than plastic explosives
and nitro in that bucket.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.520
At the bottom of it is a powerful poison!

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:04.680
<i>- What?!
- What?!
- What?!</i>

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:12.600
And here's the detonator for
the plastic explosives!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:18.160
If they blow, the poison gets spread
and it's "The End" for the well!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.480
<i>Damn you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:29.950
The contract said
I'd protect the village,

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.050
but didn't say anything about the well.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:33.480
Right, Chief?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:39.820
Without this well, the village
is worthless to the Edogawa Gang.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.260
Good thinkin', huh?

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:44.430
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:49.660
I won't let you have your way,
jerk-offs...

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.750
<i>He's gone crazy!</i>

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>P-please!</i>

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:04.120
<i>The well! I'll do
anything you say! Just...</i>

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.490
<i>...save the well from that lunatic!</i>

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:12.620
<i>Kill him right this minute!</i>

00:23:56.340 --> 00:23:58.200
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.010
<i>Sweet frontier boob lady, huh?!
Next time's an intense battle!</i>

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:05.350
<i>- Blast him to smithereens!
- Understood. I am the village chief.</i>

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:07.010
<i>What the hell're you doing?!</i>

00:24:07.010 --> 00:24:09.220
<i>On the next Sunabouzu-
"Rockets and Wandering"</i>

00:24:09.220 --> 00:24:11.240
<i>Miss it and it's your loss!</i>
